@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+.. change::
+    :tags: bug, orm
+    :tickets: 6124
+
+    Repaired support so that the :meth:`_sql.Select.params` method can work
+    correctly with a :class:`_sql.Select` object that includes joins across ORM
+    relationship structures, which is a new feature in 1.4.
+
